# No version or date-released: releases are cut automatically on every green
# push to main, so either field would be stale by the next commit.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: arena
abstract: >-
  An arena allocator for Go values whose lifetime is one batch: values are
  packed into a few large chunks and handed back as views, so a batch is a
  handful of heap objects rather than one per value, and pointer-free 12-byte
  descriptors keep retained references out of the garbage collector's scan.
authors:
  - family-names: Lindvall
    given-names: Johan
repository-code: https://github.com/JohanLindvall/arena
url: https://pkg.go.dev/github.com/JohanLindvall/arena
license: MIT
keywords:
  - go
  - arena allocator
  - memory management
  - garbage collection
